  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/tool1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Checked at dev 100b6fbb6e: no parametrised two-file same-name harness over registered analyzers exists; only PR #1702's per-analyzer fixtures (ac651f01d5). Spot check on a lua/perl/R/ruby fixture (F calls helperA in a.*, helperB in b.*): all 8 calls edges from F stay in their own file. The other ~56 analyzers are unchecked; the item stands as filed. MECHANISM: analyzers find the enclosing caller by name via the repo-wide resolver instead of by position; no cross-analyzer guard. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-kosar."  # 4285
